        </span>
        <span class="iso-wrap absolute bottom-[118px] left-[35%] z-[2] h-[106px] w-[106px]">
          <span class="iso-tile absolute inset-0 rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-white"></span>
          <svg class="iso-logo" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="46" height="46" fill="#000000" role="img" aria-label="Threads"><path d="M18.263 11.097c-.03-3.486-1.92-5.586-5.111-5.586-2.13 0-3.922.963-4.863 2.499l2.062 1.438c.535-.843 1.272-1.543 2.628-1.543 1.528 0 2.318.85 2.544 2.431a15 15 0 0 0-2.236-.173c-4.125 0-6.068 1.867-6.068 4.336s1.943 3.99 4.804 3.99c3.139 0 5.013-2.115 5.781-4.735.798.361 1.348 1.204 1.348 2.47 0 3.387-3.907 5.232-7.22 5.232-4.885 0-8.077-3.207-8.077-8.424 0-6.392 4.223-10.487 9.9-10.487 3.808 0 5.69 1.671 6.97 3.914l2.108-1.475C21.44 2.078 18.331 0 13.663 0 6.227 0 1.168 5.277 1.168 12.934c0 7 4.953 11.066 10.856 11.066 4.878 0 9.809-2.846 9.809-7.716 0-2.545-1.46-4.231-3.569-5.187m-6.33 4.855c-1.077 0-2.026-.512-2.026-1.453 0-1.483 1.822-1.934 3.606-1.934.678 0 1.34.045 1.927.173-.422 1.927-1.671 3.215-3.508 3.214Z"/></svg>
        </span>
